  "description": "29'er / 27.5+ MTB Frame\nRear Axle - 148mm x 12mm \"Boost\" Thru Axle\nBrushed Finish (not bead blasted) This can cost you hundreds of dollars from other builders\nDisc brake only (hydraulic guides can be used for cables if you want to run cable-operated brakes, too)\nMachined Head Tube and Bottom Bracket shell\nWelded 7cm Titanium Insert in top of Seat Tube (strengthens frame and allows 30.9mm seat post in an oversize seat tube)\n148mm x 12mm \"Boost spec\" titanium dropouts - comes with thru-axle\nUses external \"slip-on\" seat post binder\nBosses for rear rack (great for commuters or those long, unsupported rides) or even fenders!\nWelded Down Tube Water Bottle Lugs (no rivet to loosen)\n\"No Noodle\" design - frame flex stops here!\nAll frames are fully hand-prepped prior to shipment\n5-year warranty against defects in material and workmanship",
